+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+The project's recorded decision is to use semantic versioning (semver), with version numbers expressed as major.minor.patch to explicitly communicate the nature of each change (breaking, feature, or patch) and give users and dependent systems a clear signal about upgrade impact.
